<#f0f000>:Buttons:</>
Punch (P)                           ^X
Kick (K)                            ^A
Slash (S)                           ^Y
Heavy Slash (HS)                    ^B
Dust (D)                            ^C
Extra button                        ^Z

<#f0f000>:Modes - palette number:</>
Normal: 1-6 / EX: 7-9 / Original: 10-11 / SP: 12
GC = during guard. EX versions are regular specials.
Available moves depend on the selected mode.

<#f0f000>:Movement and system:</>
Dash                                _F_F (also in air)
Backdash                            _B_B (also in air)
High jump                           _D_U (ground)
Double jump                         _U (air)
Recovery                            ^X (any attack button)
Roman Cancel                        ^A^Y (on contact; 1000 power)
Force Roman Cancel                  ^A^Y (specific timing; 500 power)
Dead Angle Attack                   ^A^X (forward + buttons while guarding; 1000)
Burst                               ^C^A (Dust + P/K/S/HS; Burst available)
Instant Kill mode                   ^C^Z (press again to cancel)
Faultless Defense                   _B_+[^X^A/^A^Y/^Y^B/^B^X] (hold)

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX here is a character mode, selected with palettes 7–9.</>
<#aab8c7>Its EX versions are regular specials in that mode.</>
<#aab8c7>Use each listed command with its indicated button.</>
<#aab8c7>No universal two-Punch / two-Kick EX input applies.</>
<#aab8c7>Original palettes 10–11 also change some moves.</>
<#aab8c7>Meter costs for supers and system moves are listed below.</>

<#f0f000>:Special moves:</>
Tatami Gaeshi                       _D_DF_F^A (ground / air)
